    <h2 id="mcp" class="heading">MCP server</h2>
    <p class="para">Register Spryteo as an MCP server so AI agents can convert raster images and inspect vector output mid-conversation.</p>

    <h3 class="subheading">1. Install</h3>
    <CodeBlock code="cargo install spryteo-mcp" minimal />

    <h3 class="subheading">2. Configure</h3>
    <p class="para">Add the server to your client configuration:</p>
    <CodeBlock html='{<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:var(--muted);">&quot;mcpServers&quot;</span>: {<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:var(--muted);">&quot;spryteo&quot;</span>: { <span style="color:var(--muted);">&quot;command&quot;</span>: <span style="color:var(--accent);">&quot;spryteo-mcp&quot;</span> }<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>}' minimal />
