    <ul class="config-list">
      <li><strong>Claude Desktop:</strong> <code class="inline-code">~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json</code> (macOS), <code class="inline-code">%APPDATA%\Claude\claude_desktop_config.json</code> (Windows), or <code class="inline-code">~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json</code> (Linux)</li>
