      </li>
      <li><strong>Cursor:</strong> <code class="inline-code">~/.cursor/mcp.json</code> (global) or <code class="inline-code">.cursor/mcp.json</code> (project)</li>
      <li><strong>VS Code:</strong> <code class="inline-code">.vscode/mcp.json</code> (workspace) or user configuration in settings</li>
