    <h3 class="subheading">3. Verify</h3>
    <p class="para">Check that the server registered:</p>
    <ul class="config-list">
      <li><strong>Claude Desktop:</strong> Open a conversation and click the hammer icon; verify <code class="inline-code">convert_image</code> and <code class="inline-code">inspect_svg</code> appear under <code class="inline-code">spryteo</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Claude Code:</strong> Run <code class="inline-code">claude mcp list</code>; verify <code class="inline-code">spryteo</code> is listed with tools enabled.</li>
      <li><strong>Cursor / VS Code:</strong> Open the agent panel; verify <code class="inline-code">convert_image</code> and <code class="inline-code">inspect_svg</code> appear in the active tool list.</li>
