    <ul class="config-list">
      <li><strong>Command not found (<code class="inline-code">spryteo-mcp</code>):</strong> Cargo's bin directory is not on your <code class="inline-code">PATH</code>. It is <code class="inline-code">~/.cargo/bin</code> by default; export it in your shell profile (<code class="inline-code">export PATH="$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH"</code>), or set <code class="inline-code">"command"</code> in your configuration file to the absolute path of <code class="inline-code">spryteo-mcp</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Server registers but tools do not appear:</strong> The client loads configuration only on startup. Completely quit and restart your editor or client application.</li>
      <li><strong>No Rust toolchain (<code class="inline-code">cargo: command not found</code>):</strong> Install Rust from <a href="https://rustup.rs">rustup.rs</a>, open a new shell so <code class="inline-code">~/.cargo/bin</code> is on <code class="inline-code">PATH</code>, then re-run <code class="inline-code">cargo install spryteo-mcp</code>.</li>
