    <h2 id="architecture" class="heading">Crate architecture</h2>
    <p class="para">The engine is a Rust workspace of small, single-purpose crates &#8212; every surface (CLI, Node addon, WASM, MCP) links the same ones, so there's exactly one place each algorithm lives.</p>
